---
title: "Placing an order"
---
sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor S as Shopper
  participant W as Web storefront
  participant O as Order service
  participant C as Catalog service
  participant P as Payment provider
  participant K as Event bus

  S->>W: Click "Place order"
  W->>O: POST /orders (Idempotency-Key)
  activate O
  O->>O: Price cart: totals, tax, promos
  O->>C: Reserve SKUs (15 min hold)
  C-->>O: Reserved
  O->>P: Authorize payment
  alt Card declined
    P-->>O: Declined
    O->>C: Release reservation
    O-->>W: 402 Payment declined
  else Authorized
    P-->>O: Authorization id
    O->>O: Save order + outbox row (one transaction)
    O-->>W: 201 Created, order id
    O-)K: OrderPlaced (via outbox relay)
  end
  deactivate O
  W-->>S: Confirmation page
